##: {{ux|en|"How are things '''going'''?" "Not bad, thanks."}}
##* {{RQ:Shakespeare Macbeth|II|i|passage=How '''goes''' the night, boy?}}
##* {{quote-text|en|year=1727|author=w:John Arbuthnot|title=Tables of Ancient Coins, Weights and Measures. Explain'd and exemplify'd in several dissertations
