#* {{quote-book|en|year=2010|author=Luke Dixon|title=Khartoum|isbn=1848762364|page=60|passage=A shady promenade '''went''' the length of the street and the entrance to the hotel was a few steps back in the darkness, away from the glaring sunshine.}}
