#* {{quote-book|en|year=2014|author=Tim Harris|title=Politics Under the Later Stuarts|isbn=1317900383|page=195|passage=When Wharton had to relinquish his seat in Buckinghamshire on his elevation to the peerage in 1696, he was unable to replace himself with a suitable man, and the by-election '''went''' in favour of a local Tory, Lord Cheyne.}}
# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To [[tend]] (toward a result).
