##* {{quote-book|en|year=2012|author=Carolyn Keene|title=Mardi Gras Masquerade|isbn=1442465476|page=38|passage=Jackson shook his head. "The contractor said those panes could '''go''' at any moment." / "Right. Just like the wiring could '''go''' at any moment, and the roof could '''go''' at any moment."}}
